flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#1d2029,stroke:#555b68,color:#eceef1;
  classDef friction fill:#262a34,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:2px,color:#eceef1;
  classDef broken fill:#1d2029,stroke:#d77757,stroke-width:2px,color:#d77757;
  S1["1. Click Mac or press Tab: CPU, GPU, the memory<br/>grid with pressure and swap, battery, the<br/>busiest processes.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. Under memory pressure or a process over 80% CPU<br/>for a minute, the Mac tab gets a dot and the<br/>item a warning sign.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. Battery health unknown: 'health n/a', never a<br/>dash.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. Mac figures in the bar appends ' CPU 9%' to the<br/>item.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
